# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation: local-only by default, public by whitelist
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Markdown is LOCAL unless it appears in the whitelist below.
#
#   PUBLIC = tracked and pushed to AU-COBRA/AUCurves. The collaborator-facing
#            docs and every subtree README.
#   LOCAL  = working notes that never leave this checkout: planning snapshots
#            (PLAN_*, PASTA_*, PERF_*), status logs (LESSONS, TODO,
#            BUGS_FOUND), audits (*_AUDIT), the docs/ design notes and their
#            index, and the agent config (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md).
#
# To publish a new doc: add a `!/path` line here, then `git add` it.
*.md
!**/README.md
!/START-HERE.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/benchmark.md

# Process monitor / temp logs
Crypto

